msgstr "Abha is a gateway to learning about the culture of Asir, where the mountainous nature and local arts give the place its character. Here we distinguish between landmarks of the city itself, such as Shada Palace, and regional heritage such as the Asiri cat, whose presence extends to multiple communities in the region."

