msgstr "The tower was used to monitor arrivals and watch the rising stars. Its height was associated with the protection of the population and knowledge of the sky."

msgid "استُخدم الطين والحجر في البناء، والأثل وسعف النخيل في السقف؛ وتضم عمارته سرحة مكشوفة وخلوة."
msgstr "Clay and stone were used in construction, and tamarisk and palm leaves were used in the roof. Its building includes an open courtyard and a private area."

